Expense tracker

Purpose
    To track the expenses of the trip by friends

1. Only one person will manager the expenses. No need of user management.
2. One person will add memeber in his app
3. Only this person will enter the expenses
4. Each expense should capture date, description, amount
5. For one expense, there could be a sub set of friend sharing the expense.
 Not all.
6. A view will show the expenses by a person
7. A settle button at the end of trip will show the expense split by each person
